	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nesciebam hunc tam diu hic mansurum; alioquin <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>scripsissem copiosius.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nunc discessurus demum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>me convenit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Remitto igitur tibi per illum literas has tuas, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>quas nuper ad me misisti, et ago tibi pro illarum communi<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>catione ingentes gratias.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Nostri se parant ad <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>conventum <placeName ref="l28">Basiliensem</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Mittuntur legati, qui prius <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>etiam <persName>Neocomi</persName> fuerunt.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Non est animus quicquam reddere, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>sed Helvetiis communiter (fortassis tot annorum cursu <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>oblitis) ostendere et exponere, quo iure ditio hęc <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>teneatur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Sed quid futurum amplius, brevi audiemus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Dux ita tractat suos, ut nostros clam hortantur, ut ex<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>trema potius patiantur quam sub illum redeant.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Ideo <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>etiam <placeName>Tononiensis</placeName> et quędam alię praefecturę supplices a <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>senatu nostro petierunt, ne quo pacto admittant ullas <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>conditiones, quibus duci restituantur, sed eam ipsis <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>in defensione fidem praestent quam ipsi illis obediendo <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>hactenus praestiterint et deinceps quoque praestituri sint.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/><placeName>Waldenses</placeName> (sicut pro certo a consule <persName ref="p2305">Negelino</persName>, <persName ref="p8063">Steigero</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>et aliis his diebus audivi) denuo legiones illius <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>duas contra ipsos missas fuderunt et fugarunt, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>et, ut audio, septies ab illis nunc caesus est.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Civium <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>nostratium quidam his diebus <placeName ref="l167">Genevę</placeName> fuit, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>atque eo illic <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>existente venerunt quidam Italica utentes lingua <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ducentes secum mulos seu equos aliquot onustos et, quantum <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ille iudicare potuit, pecunias vexerunt.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Colligitur, quam<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>vis pro certo aestimari non possit, pecunias istas a fide<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>libus ex <placeName>Gallia</placeName> mitti <placeName>Waldensibus</placeName> istis; audimus enim eos <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>penuria laborare.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">In <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> quotidie augetur fidelium <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>numerus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Per totam <placeName>Provinciam</placeName> et <placeName>Galliam Narbonensem</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>non aiunt esse oppidulum, in quo non sit ecclesia et minister <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>certus.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Nostri <persName>Galli</persName> fere omnes discedunt; obtendunt <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>disciplinam, sed aliud quaerunt, et quamvis illis prius ad<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>modum multum sit concessum, tamen nostri eo inclinare videntur, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>ut ampliorem et liberiorem disciplinę usum sint ipsis con<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>cessuri.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Dominus det, ut ea bene utantur!</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p7449">Diesbachius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>noster proxima lunę <placeName>Mureti</placeName> nuptias celebravit cum <lb xml:id="p1z39"/><persName>Ioan[nis] Rodolphi Erlachii</persName> relicta filia.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Scriberem plura; <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>sed me nuncius expectat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Fratri nunc non licet scribere, <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>ideo illum meo nomine saluta cum tuis omnibus, am<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>icis quoque et fratribus.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Dominus nos custodiat!</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">De <placeName>Gla<lb xml:id="p1z43"/>ronensibus</placeName> quid vestri ad nostros scripserint, intellexi, <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>quid nostri respondeant, ignoro adhuc; hoc scio in<lb xml:id="p1z45"/>dignissime ferri fastum illum et insolentiam inauditam.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de">Man <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>versicht sich all tag, es werd müßen ein platsch gen.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l760">Solo<lb xml:id="p1z47"/>dorenses</placeName> et <placeName>Friburgenses</placeName> nostris in multis multa quoque <lb xml:id="p1z48"/>facessunt negotia; <foreign xml:lang="de">denn si ligend mitt disen under einer <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>decke.</foreign></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de">Gott mache es beßer, amen!</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale iterum.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z50"/>pridie ascensionis 1561.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">H[alle<lb xml:id="p1z51"/>rus]</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Adresse a.t.:]</note>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae pastori fidelissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>domino suo honorando et <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>compatri charissimo.</s>
				</p>
